file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted seat_the_ground, taking the rung as a comptime type parameter, and the four shared-module imports it reaches through
file caravan/abandon.rye one of forty-three rungs whose twenty-one-line body became a seven-line call
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the ceiling down to 80,460, the body figures resynced, and both the fold-queue and GREEN narrations rewritten for this lap
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the ceiling default moved with the assert that reads it
file crux/REMEMBER.md the Now refilled with this lap and the next crux named
recommend keep-going the queue's next head by realized fall is say_the_word at nineteen rungs by forty-six lines over a one-line signature, giving back about 774 -- check its four contract symbols public first, since three laps running have now found the signature to weigh as heavily as the family. renew_path follows at thirty-one by twenty-seven (about 720), then choose_pass at forty-three by twenty-two, whose five-line signature holds it near 630 despite ranking second by carried lines. Beside them the booked reader_path merge would fold hand_path and tell_path into one body taking suffix and companion as comptime parameters, keeping both asserts exactly; that is its own round across sixty-three rungs. The machine half of the address space stays owed, and the libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word.
